# Experiment commits

User preference recorded 2026-09-16: after an experiment is verified and its results/decision
are recorded, make a local commit without asking again. This includes rejected and inconclusive
experiments; update DEVLOG/BOTS/PLAN as applicable. Follow AGENTS.md for verification.

Respect a later explicit request not to commit. Include only the completed work and related
documentation; preserve unrelated user changes. Do not treat this as permission to push, upload
to CodinGame, or promote a strategy. Report the commit hash and experiment decision.
